            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino dwe apar i acakki me mwaka manyen, i ŋe mwaka pyeraryo wiye abic ma doŋ wari kwede i opii, i mwaka me apar wiye aŋwen ma onoŋo gaŋ me Jerucalem doŋ gituro woko, i nino meno kikome Rwot odiya ki ciŋe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 21.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci otiŋa woko i ginanyutane, okela i lobo Icrael, ka ociba piny i wi got mabor. Aneno lwak gedo mapol i nyima ma ginen calo gaŋ ma akemme kwede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 11.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma doŋ en okela kunnu, ci aneno dano mo ma nen calo mola, omako tol tworo ki lagada i ciŋe me pimo piny; en danonu onoŋo ocuŋ i doggaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci dano-nu owacca ni, “Wod pa dano, nen piny ki waŋi, dok iwiny lok ki iti, ci iket cwinyi me tamo pi gin ducu ma abinyutti, pien gikeli kany ki tyen lok ni myero anyutti gin meno ducu; in doŋ ituc gin ducu ma inenogi-ni bot jo Icrael.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
