            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.6.1+1KI.6.2+1KI.6.3+1KI.6.4+1KI.6.5+1KI.6.6+1KI.6.7+1KI.6.8+1KI.6.9+1KI.6.10+1KI.6.11+1KI.6.12+1KI.6.13+1KI.6.14+1KI.6.15+1KI.6.16+1KI.6.17+1KI.6.18+1KI.6.19+1KI.6.20+1KI.6.21+1KI.6.22+1KI.6.23+1KI.6.24+1KI.6.25+1KI.6.26+1KI.6.27+1KI.6.28+1KI.6.29+1KI.6.30+1KI.6.31+1KI.6.32+1KI.6.33+1KI.6.34+1KI.6.35+1KI.6.36+1KI.6.37+1KI.6.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 6.1-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.1+2CH.3.2+2CH.3.3+2CH.3.4+2CH.3.5+2CH.3.6+2CH.3.7+2CH.3.8+2CH.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek 3.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin ma aneno-ni aye ot pa Lubaŋa, ma girumo woko litit ki cel. Laco-nu okwanyo odoo lagadane me pimo piny ma borre romo futi apar, ci opimo cel. Onoŋo ni borre me dok malo romo futi apar, ki lacce nyo dit me kome bene romo futi apar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen oa ocito i doggaŋ ma tye yo tuŋ wokceŋ. Ka oito rwom ocito malo, ci opimo doggola ki piny i ŋom, ci oromo futi apar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki i ŋeye onoŋo tye yo ma gikato kwede, onoŋo tye iye kicika pa lukurpiny ma romo adek i ŋete acel acel. Kicika acel acel borre onoŋo tye futi apar ki lacce bene futi apar, ki cel ma onoŋo tye i kingi, lacgi nyo dit komgi onoŋo romo futi aboro. I ŋe kicika pa lukur-piny onoŋo tye iye yo me wot ma borre romo futi apar, yone onoŋo cito donyo i kicika madit ma okemo ot pa Lubaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen opimo kicika meno ma okemo ot pa Lubaŋa-ni, onoŋo lacce romo futi apar wiye aryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cel ma i ŋet doggaŋ tuŋŋi ki tuŋŋi onoŋo romo futi adek, kicika me donyo iye onoŋo tye cok ki ot pa Lubaŋa kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo tye kicika adek tuŋŋi ki tunnl i doggola ma tye yo tuŋ wokceŋ; gin kicika adek-ku ducu onoŋo ditogi romrom, ki cel ma i kin kicika bene onoŋo ditogi romrom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok opimo lac me doggaŋ ma gidonyo kwede-ni, ci oromo futi pyeraryo wiye aryo, ki doŋ ka ma twolo i doggaŋ onoŋo futi apar wiye abicel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ ki i nyim kicika pa lukur-piny acel acel onoŋo tye cel macek ma borre romo incic pyeraryo, ki dit me kome bene onoŋo romo incic pyeraryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok opimo lac me doggaŋ cakke ki i kor ot me kicika acel o kwede wa i kor ot me kicika mukene ma okemme ki lawote, ci oromo futi pyeraŋwen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dano-nu dok opimo kicika me donyo ma gikato kwede i dyekal mukene, onoŋo oromo futi pyeradek wiye aryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ bor pa yo ducu cakke ki woko i ne doggaŋ cito kwede atir wa i kicika me agikki onoŋo romo futi pyeraboro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo waŋ dirica madiŋŋe tye i kicika acel acel ki i cel ma onoŋo tye i kingi. Kicika ma i doggola me donyo bene dirica onoŋo orumo woko ducu. Cel ma i kin kicika bene onoŋo gigoro iye cal yadi otit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen dano-nu okwanya okela i dyekal ma tye yo tuŋ woko. Onoŋo tye kunnu kicika pyeradek ma orumo dyekal woko; i nyimgi tye ka ma gipeto ki gweŋ maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ma gipeto iye gwen-ni onoŋo omedde orumo dyekal woko. Man onoŋo borre rom ki bor pa doggaŋ; en aye dyekal ma woko ma tye piny ma gipeto iye gweŋ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok opimo bor piny me dyekal ma tye yo tuŋ iye ki i nyim doggaŋ ma piny, dok kwede i ŋe dyekal ma i iye, ci borre oromo futi miya acel ki pyerabicel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci lacen dano-nu otelo nyima ocito to tuŋ acam, ci nen, onoŋo tye kunnu doggaŋ ma okemo yo tuŋ acam, ma en aye doggaŋ me dyekal ma woko. Ci opimo borre ki lacce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo tye kicika adek tuŋŋi ki tuŋŋi kicika-ni, ki cel ma i kingi, ki kicika me donyo ma gikato kwede i dyekal mukene, gin ducu ditogi romrom ki dito pa gin ma tye doggaŋ mukene ca. Bor me doggaŋ onoŋo romo futi pyeraboro ki lacce onoŋo romo futi pyeraŋwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicika madit, waŋ dirica, ki cal yadi otit ma gigorogi i kom kicika onoŋo girom kimukene me doggaŋ ma okemo yo tuŋ wokceŋ-ni. Kany bene onoŋo tye iye rwom abiro ma gicito kwede i doggaŋ ki kicika me donyo onoŋo tye ki yo tuŋ i iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dogcel ma donyo i dyekal ma i iye onoŋo okemo dogcel ma tye yo tuŋ acam kit macala tye kwede yo tuŋ wokceŋ. Ci opimo nia ki i dogcel mukene o kwede wa i kom dogcel ma tye yo tuŋcel, oromo futi miya acel ki pyerabicel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok dano-nu otela tera yo tuŋ acuc; ka wao kunnu ci waneno dogcel mukene. Ci opimo cel ma i ŋet doggaŋ ki tuŋŋi, ki kicika me donyo; onoŋo ditogi rom ki mukene-gu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo tye waŋ dirica i dogcel man ki i kicika me doggola me donyo, ma girom ki waŋ dirica mukene-gu. Borre onoŋo romo futi pyeraboro, ki lacce futi pyeraŋwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo tye kunnu rwom abiro ma gicito kwede i doggaŋ, ki kicika me doggola me donyo onoŋo tye ki yo tuŋ i iye. Onoŋo bene giciro cal otit i cel ma i ŋet doggolane; acel tye tuŋcel ki mukene tye tuŋcel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok bene onoŋo tye dogcel mo yo tuŋ acuc i dyekal ma i iye. Dano-nu opimo bor piny ma tye i kin dogcel aryo-nu okemo yo tuŋ acuc, ci borre oromo futi miya acel ki pyerabicel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen dano-nu okela i dyekal ma i iye kun wadonyo ki i dogcel ma tye yo tuŋ acuc. Ci opimo dogcel ma yo tuŋ acuc, onoŋo ni ditte rom ki dito pa dogcel mukene-gu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicika ma i ŋetegu, ki cel ma i ŋet doggolane, ki kicika ma doggola me donyo onoŋo ditogi romrom ki dito pa kicika mukene-gu. Onoŋo tye waŋ dirica mapol ma orumo ki yo tuŋ i iye ki i kicika me doggola me donyo; borre onoŋo romo futi pyeraboro, ki lacce onoŋo romo futi pyeraŋwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok bene kunnu onoŋo tye iye mapol ma i doggola me donyo ma gurumo woko; borgi onoŋo romo futi pyeraŋwen ki lacgi onoŋo romo futi aboro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicika ma i doggola me donyo onoŋo okemo dyekal ma woko, ki cal yadi otit onoŋo gitye i kom cel ma i ŋet doggolane, ki yone me ito onoŋo tye ki rwom aboro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
