          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok okela i dyekal ma i iye kun wawok ki i dogcel ma tye yo tuŋ wokceŋ. Opimo dogcel, ci onoŋo ni ditte rom ki mukene-gu ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicika ma i ŋete-gu, cel ma i ŋet doggolane, ki kicika ma i doggola me donyo onoŋo ducu rom ki mukene-gu. Onoŋo tye waŋ dirica mapol ma orumo woko ki tuŋ i iye, ki kicikane ma i doggola me donye borre onoŋo romo futi pyeraboro, ki lacce onoŋo romo futi pyeraŋwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicica ma i doggola me donyune onoŋo okemo yo tuŋ dyekal ma woko. Onoŋo cal yadi otit ma gogorogo i kom cel ma ŋet doggolane ducu, acel tye yo tuŋcel ki mukene yo tuŋcel ki yone me ito malo onoŋotye ki rwom aboro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
