        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok okwanya ki i dyekal ma woko okela i dyekal ma i iye, ci aneno onoŋo tye kunnu kicika aryo; acel onoŋo tye i ŋet dogcel ma tye yo tuŋ acam, okemo yo tuŋ acuc, ki acel onoŋo tye yo tuŋ dogcel ma tye yo tuŋ acuc, okemo yo tuŋ acam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci danonu otitta ni kicika ma okemo yo tuŋ acuc-ci meno pa ajwagi ma giloyo tic i ot pa Lubaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kicika ma okemo yo tuŋ acam meno pa ajwagi ma giloyo tic i kom keno tyer. Ajwagi magi ducu gin Lulevi ma gin aye likwayo pa Jadok; ma gin keken ki i kin likwayo pa Levi aye giyegi me cito i nyim Rwot ka tic bote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
