        },
        {
          "text": "Ci dano-nu opimo dyekal ma i iye, borre onoŋo romo futi miya acel ki pyerabicel i twokke acel acel. Keno tyer onoŋo tye i nyim ot pa Lubaŋa kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen otera i i kicika ma tye i doggola ma gidonyo kwede i ot pa Lubaŋa, Ci opimo doggola me donyo; borre obedo futi aboro ki lacce futi pyeraryo wiye adek, ki dit me kom cel onoŋo romo futi abic i ŋete ryoryo ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bor pa kicika ma i doggola me donyo, ki lacce, onoŋo romo futi apar wiye aboŋwen, onoŋo bene tye rwom apar me ito malo iye. Dok bene onoŋo wir tye kunnu i ŋet doggola me donyo tuŋŋi ki tuŋŋi.",
          "type": "text",
